[b]墓主为东汉末骠骑将军张济（甘肃[color=#6699FF][url={"research": "凉州", "cat": "geography"}]凉州[/url][/color]人，[color=#6699FF][url={"research": "董卓", "cat": "people"}]董卓[/url][/color]麾下大将）[/b]

